    ownerDecision: 'The content owner decides the site’s topic relationships, commercial path, canonical strategy, and whether two articles overlap enough to require restructuring. Service owners approve statements that position a service as the next step. The reviewer can identify a mismatch but should not rewrite the site architecture or invent a conversion claim to justify a link.',
