    evidence: 'A finding should contain the source route, exact paragraph, anchor text, destination, response status, destination heading, and a short explanation of fit or mismatch. Screenshots can help with navigation defects, but text evidence matters most for meaning. Retain the observation date because a route that fits today may change later.',
