    handoff: 'Return proposed edits with the original sentence, revised sentence, destination check, reason, and approval owner. Group purely technical corrections separately from editorial changes. After approval, inspect the rendered page and destination, then record the result. A source-code change is not enough when routing, caching, or generated markup can alter what readers receive.',
