    measure: 'Review editor corrections by category: unsupported promotion, vague actor, hidden uncertainty, repeated template, overlong setup, unclear boundary, or inconsistent terminology. Sample before and after passages. Do not score voice with a single automated percentage. Tools can surface patterns, but an editor must judge whether the prose serves the reader and preserves facts.',
