    assistantWork: 'A Philippines-based assistant can export approved reports, reconcile route names, flag missing periods, add documented events, and prepare cautious observations. They should not fill data gaps with estimates, change attribution settings, declare that an article caused revenue, or rewrite a page solely because one short period declined.',
